Package: ellmercodex
Title: Codex Integration for 'ellmer'
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: person("Simon", "Herrera", email = "simxnherrera@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Simon Herrera [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Simon Herrera <simxnherrera@gmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/simxnherrera/ellmercodex
BugReports: https://github.com/simxnherrera/ellmercodex/issues
Description: Connects 'ellmer' text chats to observed subscription-backed
    'Codex' authentication and streaming response behavior. Provides a stable,
    explicitly bounded core of the complete public 'ellmer' 0.4.2 Chat object,
    including browser sign-in, package-scoped credential storage, redacted
    diagnostics, multi-turn text, streaming, structured-output, function-tool,
    asynchronous, cancellation, cloning, metadata, multimodal chat,
    account-specific model discovery, and reasoning-effort selection.
    Parallel and batch helper functions are explicitly unsupported because
    the subscription transport is stream-only. This independent third-party
    integration uses an undocumented compatibility transport, is not endorsed
    by OpenAI, and may stop working without notice.
